<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate">
    <meta http-equiv="Pragma" content="no-cache">
    <title><%= title %> - 유니크 특허사무소</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/ejs-style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/favicon.svg">

    <style>
        .rm-toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .rm-toolbar-group { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; }
        .rm-toolbar select { padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; background: #fff; }
        .rm-search { padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 200px; }
        .rm-section-title { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; }
        .rm-log-filter { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #374151; }
        .rm-log-filter input { padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        .rm-card .admin-table td.rm-log-items { white-space: normal; font-size: 0.78rem; line-height: 1.6; min-width: 320px; }
        .rm-report-to { padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 190px; }
        .rm-toolbar label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #374151; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem; cursor: pointer; }
        .rm-btn { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; background: #fff; color: #374151; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; }
        .rm-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
        .rm-btn-primary { background: #54B435; border-color: #54B435; color: #fff; }
        .rm-btn-dark { background: #0F172A; border-color: #0F172A; color: #fff; }
        .rm-btn-sm { padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; font-size: 0.78rem; }
        .rm-progress { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b; }
        .stat-tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
        .stat-tile { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem; }
        .stat-label { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
        .stat-value { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; line-height: 1.2; }
        .rm-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; }
        .rm-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
        .rm-card .admin-table td, .rm-card .admin-table th { font-size: 0.85rem; white-space: nowrap; vertical-align: middle; }
        .rm-card .admin-table select { padding: 0.25rem 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; max-width: 170px; }
        .rm-count { background: none; border: none; color: #166534; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 0; }
        .rm-detail td { background: #f8fafc; white-space: normal !important; }
        .rm-detail table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0.25rem 0; }
        .rm-detail th, .rm-detail td.cell { border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: left; background: #fff; white-space: nowrap; }
        .rm-detail td.cell-title { white-space: normal !important; min-width: 160px; }
        .rm-detail th { background: #f1f5f9; color: #334155; }
        .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 0.12rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; }
        .tag-due { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
        .tag-late { background: #ffedd5; color: #9a3412; }
        .tag-recovery { background: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; }
        .tag-sent { background: #e0f2fe; color: #075985; }
        .tag-failed { background: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; }
        .muted { color: #94a3b8; }
        .text-err { color: #b91c1c; }
        .notice { padding: 0.9rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 1rem; display: none; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
        #errorNotice { white-space: pre-line; }
        .notice-error { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; color: #b91c1c; }
        .notice-warn { background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; color: #92400e; }
        .notice-ok { background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #86efac; color: #166534; }
        .rm-modal { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); display: none; justify-content: center; align-items: center; z-index: 1000; padding: 16px; }
        .rm-modal-box { background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; width: 100%; max-width: 820px; max-height: 92vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }
        .rm-modal-head { padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #54B435; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
        .rm-modal-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0F172A; }
        .rm-modal-meta { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #64748b; margin-top: 0.35rem; line-height: 1.6; word-break: break-all; }
        .rm-modal-close { background: none; border: none; font-size: 1.5rem; cursor: pointer; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1; }
        .rm-modal iframe { border: 0; width: 100%; flex: 1; min-height: 60vh; background: #f1f5f9; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header admin-header">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header-content">
                <a href="/" class="logo">
                    유니크<span>특허</span>
                    <span class="admin-badge">관리자</span>
                </a>
                <button class="hamburger" id="hamburgerBtn" aria-label="메뉴 열기">
                    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
                </button>
                <nav class="nav-tabs" id="navTabs">
                    <a href="/registered" class="nav-link">등록특허 현황</a>
                    <a href="/application2" class="nav-link">출원특허 현황</a>
                    <a href="/admin/stats" class="nav-link">이용 통계</a>
                    <a href="/admin/reminders" class="nav-link active">납부기한 알림</a>
                    <a href="/admin" class="nav-link">기존 회원</a>
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="nav-link" id="logoutBtn">로그아웃</a>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="page-title">
                <h1>납부기한 알림 메일</h1>
                <p>오늘 기준 향후 2개월 이내에 연차료 납부마감일 · 추납기간 마감 · 회복기간 마감이 도래하는 회원에게 안내 메일을 보냅니다</p>
            </div>

            <div class="notice notice-error" id="errorNotice"></div>
            <div class="notice notice-warn" id="configNotice">
                메일 발송 설정이 되어 있지 않습니다. Vercel 환경변수에 <strong>RESEND_API_KEY</strong>, <strong>REMINDER_FROM</strong>
                (예: <code>유니크 특허사무소 &lt;noreply@unicpat.com&gt;</code>)을 등록해주세요. 조회와 미리보기는 사용할 수 있습니다.
            </div>
            <div class="notice notice-ok" id="resultNotice"></div>

            <div class="rm-toolbar">
                <div class="rm-toolbar-group">
                    <button type="button" class="rm-btn rm-btn-dark" id="scanAllBtn">전체 대상 조회</button>
                    <button type="button" class="rm-btn" id="scanStopBtn" style="display:none;">조회 중지</button>
                    <span class="rm-progress" id="progressText"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="rm-toolbar-group">
                    <input type="search" id="memberSearch" class="rm-search" placeholder="이름·회사명·고객번호 검색" aria-label="회원 검색">
                    <select id="typeFilter" aria-label="구분 필터">
                        <option value="">구분: 전체</option>
                        <option value="due">납부마감</option>
                        <option value="late">추납기간</option>
                        <option value="recovery">회복기간</option>
                    </select>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" id="onlyTargets" checked> 대상 있는 회원만</label>
                    <label for="reportTo" title="발송할 때마다 이번 발송 내역 전체를 1통으로 모아 이 주소로 보냅니다 (비우면 보내지 않음)">총괄메일</label>
                    <input type="text" id="reportTo" class="rm-report-to" value="ljunhyek@naver.com" placeholder="비우면 보내지 않음">
                    <button type="button" class="rm-btn rm-btn-primary" id="sendBtn" disabled>선택 회원에게 발송 (0명)</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-tiles">
                <div class="stat-tile"><div class="stat-label">회원 수</div><div class="stat-value" id="tileMembers">-</div></div>
                <div class="stat-tile"><div class="stat-label">조회 완료</div><div class="stat-value" id="tileScanned">-</div></div>
                <div class="stat-tile"><div class="stat-label">대상 회원</div><div class="stat-value" id="tileTargets">-</div></div>
                <div class="stat-tile"><div class="stat-label">대상 특허</div><div class="stat-value" id="tileItems">-</div></div>
            </div>

            <section class="rm-card">
                <div class="rm-table-wrap">
                    <table class="admin-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th><input type="checkbox" id="checkAll" aria-label="전체 선택"></th>
                                <th>회원명</th>
                                <th>이메일</th>
                                <th>조회 번호</th>
                                <th>감면유형</th>
                                <th>대상 특허</th>
                                <th>가장 빠른 기한</th>
                                <th>조회 일시</th>
                                <th>최근 발송</th>
                                <th></th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="membersBody">
                            <tr><td colspan="10" class="muted" style="text-align:center;">불러오는 중...</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </section>

            <h2 class="rm-section-title">발송 내역</h2>
            <section class="rm-card">
                <div class="rm-log-filter">
                    <input type="date" id="logFrom" aria-label="시작일"> ~ <input type="date" id="logTo" aria-label="종료일">
                    <button type="button" class="rm-btn rm-btn-sm" data-range="1">오늘</button>
                    <button type="button" class="rm-btn rm-btn-sm" data-range="7">최근 1주일</button>
                    <button type="button" class="rm-btn rm-btn-sm" data-range="30">최근 1개월</button>
                    <input type="search" id="logSearch" class="rm-search" placeholder="이름·이메일 (선택)" aria-label="발송 내역 검색">
                    <button type="button" class="rm-btn rm-btn-dark rm-btn-sm" id="logSearchBtn">조회</button>
                    <span class="rm-progress" id="logSummary"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="rm-table-wrap">
                    <table class="admin-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr><th>발송 일시</th><th>회원명</th><th>이메일</th><th>특허</th><th>안내한 특허</th><th>결과</th><th>발송자</th></tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="logsBody">
                            <tr><td colspan="7" class="muted" style="text-align:center;">기간을 선택하고 조회를 눌러주세요.</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>

    <div class="rm-modal" id="previewModal">
        <div class="rm-modal-box">
            <div class="rm-modal-head">
                <div>
                    <h2>메일 미리보기</h2>
                    <div class="rm-modal-meta" id="previewMeta"></div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="rm-modal-close" id="previewClose" aria-label="닫기">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <iframe id="previewFrame" title="메일 미리보기" sandbox=""></iframe>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/admin-reminders.js?v=2026.10.26.v2"></script>
    <script>
    document.getElementById('logoutBtn').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        fetch('/api/logout').finally(function() { window.location.href = '/?logout=1'; });
    });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
